    "_source": "Decided: in possession control jumps to the carrier; defending, A switches to the defender who reaches the ball's path soonest (never the keeper); auto-switch by SwitchSensitivity (0 off, 1 most eager). Margins: PROPOSAL, Master B brief Oct 11.",
